# The frontend uses the same-origin /api/v1 path through the loopback Vite proxy.
# Development defaults to the OSM standard tiles. Set both values for a provisioned provider.
# An empty tile URL disables the basemap. Capture maps always render locally without external tiles.
# VITE_MAP_OD_TILE_URL=https://tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png
# VITE_MAP_OD_TILE_ATTRIBUTION=© <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">OpenStreetMap</a> contributors
